    "root_cause": "In Mistral and Llama pre-LN architectures, residual additions accumulate across all 32 transformer blocks without intermediate normalization on the trunk. HuggingFace outputs.hidden_states[32] stores the final layer output BEFORE the final model.norm (RMSNorm). This causes the vector magnitude to naturally scale to ~160-180. Embeddings are kept unnormalized in cache to preserve fidelity."
